---
description: Use KissMyPost tools for any Reddit numbers (subreddit size, growth, timing, mentions). Apply when the user asks about subreddits, Reddit audiences or Reddit marketing.
alwaysApply: false
---

- For Reddit numbers, call the KissMyPost MCP tools. Do not guess subscriber counts, growth, posting times or mention counts from memory.
- Quote the period each number refers to and keep the report link the tool returns.
- The tools are read-only. They do not post, vote or message anyone on Reddit; do not offer those actions.
- Never suggest posting the same message to many subreddits. Point the user to each community's rules first (`subreddit_posting_rules` when available).
- If a tool says it is unavailable for the account or a daily limit is reached, say so plainly and continue with the other tools.
